WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.044
Welcome to Orbit. New experiences. Our focus is Present Perfect.

2
00:00:07.044 --> 00:00:16.736
Use have or has plus a past participle for an experience or a result connected to now. Use the past simple with a finished past time.

3
00:00:16.736 --> 00:00:19.686
She has not booked a hotel yet.

4
00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.355
I have never climbed a mountain.

5
00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:25.084
She went to Italy last summer.

6
00:00:25.084 --> 00:00:34.482
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
